        "content": {
          "format": "source-lines",
          "lines": [
            "1. Hallelujah, he hallelujah amen!",
            "Kalvary zauzian zeihaeng paan khou rui;",
            "Kapmei le rianra zinghmei ram khou hei,",
            "Neihlamei tingkao riu gaan guang o.",
            "",
            "Neihlamei tuai dat mak,",
            "Hallelujah, hallelujah;",
            "Thuanmmei su diu he! Lauziu Na ta,",
            "Kazauzian rui rianramei timan.",
            "",
            "2. He! Bumaeng Thanmei le neihlamei kei o,",
            "Hallelujah tuna rianra ram khou;",
            "Neihlana suan ni e rianra nun rui,",
            "Nang bam tei aniu tingkao suni.",
            "",
            "3. Tingsaeng rianramei ram guai ‘manpui kaan khou,",
            "Neihla tingkao saron nun gaimei tei;",
            "Tingsaenga puang puni tuai dat makna,",
            "Nangta ning liang e nduanglou o.",
            "",
            "4. Kandihmei rui thaidiu Poubaomei ram tei,",
            "Tingkao thanmei nun ni neihla kandiu;",
            "Kalvary lauziu Na ‘zianlou mei Pu;",
            "Nangta ninga suan ni tingsaengzaeng."
          ]
        }
      }
    },
